<title>POLAND: POLISH PBI BANK CUTS CAR CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>POLISH PBI BANK CUTS CAR CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Investment Bank (PBI) will cut its credit rates for car purchases as of December 16, PBI said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said it would cut its 12-month credit rates to 21.8 percent from 22.5 percent and 60-month credit rates to 23.3 percent from 24.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
